### All leagues
GET http://localhost:8080/api/leagues

### Create a league
POST http://localhost:8080/api/leagues
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Premier League", "country": "England"}

### Create a league
POST http://localhost:8080/api/leagues
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Bundersliga", "country": "Germany"}

### Create a league
POST http://localhost:8080/api/leagues
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Efbet League", "country": "Bulgaria"}

### Invalid: empty name
POST http://localhost:8080/api/leagues
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "country": "Italy"}

###AllTeams
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teams

###Create a team
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Juventus", "city": "Turin", "leagueId": 4}

### Invalid: empty name
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "city": "Turin"}

###AllPlayers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/players

###firstPlayer
GET http://localhost:8080/api/players/1

###Invalid: Player page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/players/99

###Invalid: Leagues page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/leagues/99

###Invalid: teams page
GET http://localhost:8080/api/teams/99

###Create a player
POST http://localhost:8080/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Declan Rice", "position": "Midfielder","shirtNumber": 47,"teamId": 1}

### Invalid: empty name
POST http://localhost:8080/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "", "position": "Midfielder", "shirtNumber": 47, "teamId": 1}

### Invalid: empty shirtNumber
POST http://localhost:8080/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Declan Rice", "position": "Midfielder", "teamId": 1}

### Team in missing league
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Ghost FC", "city": "Nowhere", "leagueId": 99}

### Player in missing team
POST http://localhost:8080/api/players
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Nobody", "position": "Forward", "shirtNumber": 9, "teamId": 99}
